54,"text":"これ、本当にフォンテーヌのマシンが作り出したおもちゃなのか…？","nextNodeIds":[726960402]},{"nodeId":726960402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":538052066,"text":"…なんか、フォンテーヌのイメージと違うけど。","nextNodeIds":[726960403]},{"nodeId":726960403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":961111594,"text":"フォンテーヌ風のおもちゃロボットを作るだけのマシンでは、商業的に成功とは言えない。","nextNodeIds":[726960404]},{"nodeId":726960404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":3784099178,"text":"そこで、現地で流行している文化的な要素を取り入れている。現地の人々にとって身近なものでなければ、人気は出ないからな。","nextNodeIds":[726960405]},{"nodeId":726960405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2342418986,"text":"本当にこれで人気が出るのか？","nextNodeIds":[726960406]},{"nodeId":726960406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":1409973586,"text":"コホンッ…最初は誤解されるかもしれないが、根気よく商品を改良していけば、必ずや心を動かすことができるはずだ！","nextNodeIds":[726960407]},{"nodeId":726960407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":812976074,"text":"とにかく、これで一回目の製造が終わった。","nextNodeIds":[726960408]},{"nodeId":726960408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":4271526418,"text":"どうだ、凄く面白いだろ。","nextNodeIds":[726960409]},{"nodeId":726960409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1391117922,"text":"面白さは普通。","nextNodeIds":[726960410]},{"nodeId":726960410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":3418135602,"text":"ふむ、なるほど。この材料の割合で作れるおもちゃはこれなのか。よし、倉庫にしまっておこう。ああ、それとこの引換券を君にあげよう。","nextNodeIds":[726960417]},{"nodeId":726960417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":398288026,"text":"この引換券で、これと同じ形のロボットを無料で引き換えることができる。これを気に入ったなら、安定生産が終わった後に引換券を使いに来るといい。","nextNodeIds":[726960418]},{"nodeId":726960418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":842316914,"text":"さて…初めて作ったおもちゃのロボットだから、少し検査をするとしよう。また爆発するものを作っていたら困るしな。","nextNodeIds":[726960411]},{"nodeId":726960411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":2307424746,"text":"試運転で起きた問題記録は…ふむ、効率を上げるには調整が必要だな。","nextNodeIds":[726960412]},{"nodeId":726960412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3452138354,"text":"仕事のことになると、結構まじめだよな。","nextNodeIds":[726960413]},{"nodeId":726960413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":724830690,"text":"当然だ。俺は一人だからな、頼れるのはこのマシンと製造工程だけだ。","nextNodeIds":[726960414]},{"nodeId":726960414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":3684123922,"text":"まあ、前に俺を捕まえた同心からは「奇技淫巧」の自己満足だと罵られたが…ふんっ、本気になった「奇技淫巧」をナメるなよ。","nextNodeIds":[726960415]},{"nodeId":726960415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":2831822730,"text":"俺の製造が一刻も早く大業を成すためにも、まずは調整に励むとしよう。","nextNodeIds":[726960416]},{"nodeId":726960416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerName":"バートランド","textMapHash":1634080138,"text":"#その時は、君も手伝いに来てくれよな、{NICKNAME}！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7269604,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30187"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7269601,7269602,7269603,7269604,7269605],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30187,"speakerNa